---
description: "Secrets, proxy, and client bundle safety."
globs:
  - "src/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "proxy/**/*"
  - "scripts/**/*"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Security

- No secrets in source or client bundle
- Env-only CloudFront / AWS / Sentry credentials for scripts and proxy
- Proxy must fail closed when CloudFront signing config is missing
- Do not log tokens or PII carelessly
- See `docs/SECURITY.md`
